<h2>💡 Tips</h2>
<h3>📲 Add the community to your home screen</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>iPhone:</strong> Open the link in Safari, tap Share (the square with an arrow) → “Add to Home Screen”</li>
<li><strong>Android:</strong> Open the link in Chrome, tap ⋮ → “Add to Home screen”</li>
</ul>
<h3>🧵 Reply in a thread</h3>
<ul>
<li>Tap ••• on a message → “Reply in thread”. The threads you’re in are under Threads.</li>
</ul>
<h3>📍 Meet members near you</h3>
<ul>
<li>Add your city in your profile (tap your photo in the menu) to join your local chat.</li>
<li>See who’s around in Members → Nearby.</li>
<li>Travelling? Change your city to meet members there!</li>
</ul>
<h3>✉️ Message someone privately</h3>
<ul>
<li>Tap a member’s photo → “DM”, or open DMs in the menu.</li>
</ul>
